, "ec000095": {"type":"text","parent":"ec000094","order":"a0","name":"Most map users are not exploring. They …","w":774,"content":"Most map users are not exploring. They are late, on a phone with 9% battery, and need the next turn. Hana walks through three years of research on stressed navigation, the features her team removed, and the one they had to put back.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"size":18,"typography":{"$ref":"type/body"}},"fill":{"$ref":"color/on-blue"}}

